1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,600
Ready to make date night more fun?

2
00:00:02,788 --> 00:00:05,134
Here’s what’s new in A Date At las!

3
00:00:05,555 --> 00:00:08,051
First, set the mood with music.

4
00:00:08,255 --> 00:00:11,065
In Step by step, tap the little character.

5
00:00:11,255 --> 00:00:13,377
Go for Afrobeats, melodic trap,

6
00:00:13,377 --> 00:00:15,586
or whatever feels right.

7
00:00:16,022 --> 00:00:17,415
Next up, Plan Together.

8
00:00:17,622 --> 00:00:20,199
Send an invite. They can say yes,

9
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:22,881
suggest a new vibe, or pick another time.

10
00:00:23,088 --> 00:00:25,603
No signup needed. Review their reply

11
00:00:25,603 --> 00:00:28,220
in My dates and send an updated invite.

12
00:00:28,655 --> 00:00:30,780
Third, give date night a backup.

13
00:00:30,988 --> 00:00:33,292
If your first spot is full or closed,

14
00:00:33,292 --> 00:00:35,690
you’ve already got somewhere else to go.

15
00:00:35,888 --> 00:00:38,744
Save one backup venue right alongside the date.

16
00:00:39,188 --> 00:00:41,557
And finally, a shared wishlist.

17
00:00:41,755 --> 00:00:44,379
Both of you can save places to the same list.

18
00:00:44,588 --> 00:00:46,761
See a spot you both love?

19
00:00:46,761 --> 00:00:49,023
Start your next date right from there.

20
00:00:49,455 --> 00:00:51,429
That’s your next date, sorted.

21
00:00:51,622 --> 00:00:54,954
Find A Date At las at a date atlas dot com.

